# Trivy vulnerability ignore list.
#
# Every entry below must carry: the CVE id, a one-line justification, an owner,
# and a review/expiry date. An entry past its expiry date should be treated as
# a build failure waiting to happen — re-run Trivy and either fix or renew it.
#

# No active suppressions.
#
# History: CVE-2026-68525, CVE-2026-65905 and CVE-2026-65182 (embedded Apache
# Tomcat via spring-boot-starter-parent 4.1.0) were accepted here on
# 2026-09-29 with a review-by date of 2026-10-13 because no patched parent
# could be verified. On 2026-10-13 the parent was bumped to 4.1.1 (managed
# Tomcat 11.0.24, see docs/adr/0010-spring-boot-parent-bump.md) and the
# entries were removed; the Trivy job decides whether they were still needed.
